BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:'Actually\, It Is Rocket Science' at Jane Pickens\, presented by T
 eton Gravity Research
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261111
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261112
DTSTAMP:20261111T180154Z
UID:f71d9ded5af08502e7526726b10e@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:'Actually\, It Is Rocket Science' A Teton Gravity Research Fil
 m When: Wednesday\, November 11th at 7:30 PM Where: Jane Pickens Theater\,
  49 Touro Street\, Newport Join Teton Gravity Research for its 31st annual
  ski and snowboard film\, featuring elite athletes\, breathtaking cinemato
 graphy\, and the year's biggest mountain adventures. Experience the excite
 ment\, community\, and stoke of ski season on the big screen. This is the 
 newest TGR film on the big screen with a night celebrating the ski and sno
 wboard community. Actually\, It Is Rocket Science brings together the worl
 d’s best athletes\, groundbreaking terrain\, and unforgettable stories f
 rom the mountains. Enjoy the film\, connect with fellow fans\, and stick a
 round for giveaways\, prizes\, and more. Tickets On Sale Now\, More detail
 s and Trailer coming soon! Genre: Action/Adventure Tickets: $22 for Adults
 \; $15 for Kids under 16 Release Date: 2026 Runtime: 120 minutes\n\nSource
 : https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/actually-it-is-rocket-science-at-
 jane-pickens-presented-by-teton-gravity-research/111305/
LOCATION:Jane Pickens Theater\, 49 Touro Street\, Newport\, RI 02840 Time:
  7:30 PM to 10:30 PM
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/actually-it-is-rocket-science-a
 t-jane-pickens-presented-by-teton-gravity-research/111305/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
