UID:91d0c45995c76bb3e4e4d4172d7a@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:RHODE ISLAND CHRISTMAS FESTIVAL COMING TO WEST WARWICK THIS NO
 VEMBER WEST WARWICK\, R.I. — Community Marketing RI is pleased to announ
 ce the annual Rhode Island Christmas Festival\, taking place November 21 a
 nd 22 at the West Warwick Civic Center. This family-friendly festive event
  features over 150 local vendors\, entertainment\, and food trucks to kick
  off the holiday shopping season. Admission and parking are both completel
 y free for all attendees. Event Details: - Dates &amp\; Times: - Saturday
 \, November 21: 10:00 a.m. &#8211\; 4:00 p.m. - Sunday\, November 22: 11:0
 0 a.m. &#8211\; 3:00 p.m. - Location: West Warwick Civic Center\, 100 Fact
 ory St.\, West Warwick\, RI - Admission: FREE - Parking: FREE Attendees ca
 n shop a wide variety of unique gifts\, crafts\, specialized goods\, and f
 ood from over 150 participating exhibitors\, including: - Food &amp\; Dini
 ng: Azraas Kitchen\, Big D's Hot Sauce LLC\, Deja Brew Cafe RI\, Dolci di 
 Giovanna\, Edgewood Cheese Shop\, Griddle Me This Food Truck\, La Loncheri
 ta Food Truck\, Lady Ann Candies\, Lemon Lane LLC/Sweets On The Lane\, Mad
 e By Vicki Jams and Jellies\, Nothing Bundt Cakes\, Susan’s Sweet Treats
 \, Texas Roadhouse\, The Dublin Stack\, The Fine Bake Shop\, The Rise Cafe
 \, V's Sweet Shop - Crafts &amp\; Handmade Gifts: A Little Bit of Everythi
 ng Gifts\, Art by Lynne Albright\, Artefacts Collection\, Bo's Boards\, Bu
 tterfly Pin &amp\; Stitch\, Celona Legacy Woodworks\, CharBella Designs\, 
 Chez Lucie\, ClassyCreations04\, Cole Quilts\, Coloring with Fire\, Creati
 vely Crafted by Linda &amp\; Christina\, Crooked Dragonfly\, Crystal's Cus
 tom Creations\, Dad and Daughter Designs RI\, Deb Petteruti Glass Art\, De
 bs Crafts\, Dreaming Light Creations\, Dust Bunnie Crafts\, Engraved Elega
 nce by Vickie\, Follow Your Heart Creations\, Fox &amp\; Mouse Print House
 \, Gammie's Craft Corner and Handmade by Donna\, GoneKrafty27\, Grammy Joa
 n Handmade\, Grit and Grace Custom Creations\, Heavy Metal Animals\, J and
  J Designs\, Janetarts\, Joan B's Treasures from the Sea\, Katie Creations
 \, KrystallosArt by Ile\, Lar’s Creations\, Mel's Crafty Nook\, Misc By 
 Macy\, MKJ Designs LLC\, Once Upon a Fiber\, Patty's Crafts\, Regali Desig
 ns\, Sacred Sol Design\, Samantha's Cozy Creations / Nic's Handsewn\, Seas
 ide Stitches by Lynn\, Seasonal and Oceanic Inspirations\, See What I Saw
 \, Sewfisticated Designs by Cissy\, Silva's Custom Designs\, Simply 3D LLC
 \, Stainz Creations\, Stitcheswithlove365\, Sunflower Beach Arts\, Twin Ch
 icken Studios\, Unique Crafts by A&amp\;C\, Unique Finds\, Wooster Creatio
