 udents\, and visitors can enjoy winter games\, photos with Santa\, charity
  raffles\, and a festive outdoor market filled with handmade gifts. Admiss
 ion is free\, and everyone is invited to celebrate the start of the holida
 y season in the heart of Bristol.\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.
